OL,3,GNEWSAChris Kamara to take on Children
OL,4,Ain Need challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer footballer Chris Kamara is to
OL,7,Fjoin schoolchildren in a running
OL,8,Fchallenge for Children in Need as he
OL,9,Fcontinues his fitness journey after
OL,10,Fbeing diagnosed with apraxia.
OL,12,FThe former Bradford City player and
OL,13,Fmanager, who is also a sports
OL,14,Fbroadcaster, said he had to relearn how
OL,15,Fto run after being diagnosed with the
OL,16,Fneurological condition which has
OL,17,Faffected his speech, balance and
OL,18,Fmovement.
OL,20,FKamara completed the Great North Run in
OL,21,FSeptember and now hopes to compete in
OL,22,Fthe London Marathon next year.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
