OL,3,GNEWSAChris Kamara to take on Children
OL,4,Ain Need challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the Children in Need challenge he
OL,7,Fwill join retired Olympian Jonny
OL,8,FBrownlee to help children at Outwood
OL,9,FPrimary Academy Lofthouse Gate run a
OL,10,Fcollective 500 miles in just four hours
OL,11,Fon 10 November.
